{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Street Fighter Alpha","Ryu, the current Street Fighter champion, must overcome the power of the \"Dark Hadou\" which consumed Akuma, the brother of his sensei, Gouken. Plus, he deals with the unexpected arrival of Shun, a young boy who proclaims to be his long-lost brother.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["ストリートファイターZERO - THE ANIMATION -",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":950,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-979","ids":{"shikimori":979,"mal":979,"anilist":979,"kodik":"serial-28284"},"kodikIds":["serial-28283","serial-28284"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-28283":"2020-08-02T22:16:17Z","serial-28284":"2020-08-02T22:16:57Z"},"title":"Уличный боец Зеро","originalTitle":"Street Fighter Zero: The Animation","alt":"Уличный боец: Альфа Street Fighter Alpha ストリートファイターZERO - THE ANIMATION -","description":"Действующий чемпион уличных боёв Рю ведёт борьбу с энергией тёмного хадо внутри себя. Он отправляется в путешествие с целью найти способ научиться контролировать негативную силу, поселившуюся в нём. Этот путь с ним разделят: его лучший друг и бывший спарринг-партнёр — Кен Мастерс , китайский агент Интерпола — Чунь Ли и объявившийся из ниоткуда его сводный брат Шун.","year":1999,"type":"MOVIE","genres":["Экшен","Драма","боевые искусства","супер сила"],"rating":6.51,"popularity":3804,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[950],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/979/054b83cfa25152f5bc4bde8a03b4682d.jpeg","width":433,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/29d4a2e3271ab6054db0248d082dda8f1273dde1.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-594","dubId":"594","label":"Назаров","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-